**Interpretation.** Three administrative streams capture different severities. NMC (~690) counts clinically-notified cases; NHLS (~2,000) counts severe BChE inhibitions on live patients; PIH (~9,000) counts helpline consultations. Each stream is independently sourced; the sum is treated as the upper bound of the true annual burden pending record-linkage.

